{"availability":"available","full":"HarshSharma07k/vahan-mitra","name":"vahan-mitra","description":"Vahan Mitra — a citizen-side redesign of Parivahan Sewa, India's transport portal, built for the Build What Moves India hackathon. Zero trips. Zero jargon. Zero agents. Frontend-only, seeded-data demo on Next.js 15 + TypeScript.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-23T13:25:09Z","updated":"2026-08-28T08:59:47Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://vahan-mitra-inky.vercel.app","topics":["civic-tech","government-services","hackathon","india","nextjs","shadcn-ui","tailwindcss","typescript","ux-design","zustand"],"demo":"https://vahan-mitra-inky.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.353Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.353Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.353Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.353Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["vahan-mitra-inky.vercel.app — deployed on Vercel, no login or setup needed.","The landing page has one-click login cards for all three, so no typing is needed. The mobile+OTP form works too; any OTP is accepted and the field prefills with 1234.","Everything runs offline from seeded mock data. There is no backend and no account to create."],"features":["No admin, RTO-staff, or dealer views. Scoped to the citizen only.","Vehicles isn't in the 5-item mobile bottom nav, an intentional cut to keep the bar at five; vehicle status still shows on the mobile dashboard.","No real payment flow. Paying a fine flips its status locally with no gateway behind it.","Next up: a real OCR/NLP backend behind the same mockApi.ts boundary, and a payments integration."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HarshSharma07k/vahan-mitra/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"50603d7ef9a8f4bb80fad2a337bfe1841370ec5b72dca0a6bebe6617bd71d290","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:08.449Z"},"overviewCheckedAt"